nutes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"What is Frank Skinner&#39;s age in minutes\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>What is Frank Skinner's age in minutes?\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">22\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>22\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/The_poet_and_the_egg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><small><i>Video unavailable in some regions. Find an alternative service <a href=\"/wiki/Watch_Taskmaster\" title=\"Watch Taskmaster\">here</a>.</i></small>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"> <a href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/File:Taskmaster_-_Series_1,_Episode_3_%27The_poet_and_the_egg%27\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium \"> \t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ee/Taskmaster_-_Series_1%2C_Episode_3_%27The_poet_and_the_egg%27/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20210130003843\" alt=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_1,_Episode_3_&#39;The_poet_and_the_egg&#39;\" height=\"263\" width=\"350\" data-video-key=\"Taskmaster_-_Series_1,_Episode_3_&#39;The_poet_and_the_egg&#39;\" data-video-name=\"Taskmaster - Series 1, Episode 3 &#39;The poet and the egg&#39;\" class=\"\" /> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t<svg class=\"thumbnail-play-icon wds-icon\" aria-label=\"Play\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-pla